{
  "slug": "pok-dex",
  "name": "Pok Dex",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Complete Pokemon Pokedex for Claude Code covering all 1,025 Pokemon across Generations 1–9. Includes base stats, abilities, egg groups, catch rates, type effectiveness charts, and a 765-move database with power, accuracy, PP, and effect descriptions. Ideal for Pokemon fans, game developers, and data analysts who want instant Pokedex lookups, type matchup calculations, or ready-to-use JSON datasets for building Pokemon apps and tools.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `pokemon-pokedex` (Comprehensive Pokemon Pokedex skill covering all 1,025 Pokemon across Generations 1–9).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install pok-dex@claude-community` from `SNLabat/Pokemon-Pokedex-Plugin`.\n\nA comprehensive Pokemon Pokedex plugin for Claude Code. Covers all 1,025 Pokemon across Generations 1–9 with full base stats, abilities, moves, type matchups, species data, and Pokedex entries from every main series game.",
